rc Flash (Office)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Arc Flash (Pump Station)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Confined Space Entry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Electrical Safety (Type 1 Switchgear)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Electrical Safety (Type 2 Switchgear)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Fire Safety (Office)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Fire Safety (Workshop)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. First Aid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. Forklift Hazard Recognition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Forklift Pre-operational Inspection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11. Hot Work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12. Load Slinging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13. Lockout Tagout (LOTO)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14. Maintenance Safety (Pipes and Acids)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15. Personal Protective Equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16. Risk Assessment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17. Road accident with dangerous goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18. Scaffolding (Bakers Scaffolding Assembly)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19. Scaffolding (Wedge Lock Scaffolding Assembly Training)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20. Trenching and Excavation (Field Work)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21. Trenching and Excavation (Road Construction)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22. Truck preparation for driving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23. Underground roof fall hazard assessment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24. Work at height</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25. Workplace safety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All VR Training consists of 3 modes: <strong>Study, Training, Exam</strong>, providing step-by-step control of all VR activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language support:</strong> English, Bahasa Melayu (بهاس ملايو), Čeština, Deutsch, Español, Français, Italiano, Latviešu, Nederlands, Polski, Português, Slovenčina, Svenska, Tiếng Việt, Türkçe, اَلْعَرَبِيَّةُ, فارسی, 普通话 (中国大陆), 